glmtrans                Fit a transfer learning generalized linear
                        model (GLM) with elasticnet regularization.
glmtrans_inf            Calculate asymptotic confidence intervals based
                        on desparsified Lasso and two-step transfer
                        learning method.
models                  Generate data from Gaussian, logistic and
                        Poisson models.
